    "lineStart": 0,
    "memoText": "\n                         VETO MESSAGE - No. 517\n\nTO THE SENATE:\n\nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n\nSenate Bill Number 6124-A, entitled:\n\n    \"AN  ACT  in  relation  to  legalizing,  validating,  ratifying  and\n      confirming a transportation contract of the Perry  central  school\n      district\"\n\nTO THE ASSEMBLY:\n\nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n\nAssembly Bill Number 9977-A, entitled:\n\n    \"AN  ACT  to  provide  for the repayment by the Johnson City central\n      school district of certain excess state payments\"\n\n    NOT APPROVED\n\n  Each of these bills would authorize, outside the State Budget process,\npayment of State education aid above the amounts calculated  and  previ-\nously agreed to under current law.\n\n  Assembly  Bill  Number  9977-A  would  allow  the Johnson City Central\nSchool District to repay a $1.99 million Building Aid  overpayment  over\nsix years rather than over three years. As a result, the school district\nwould receive $1.1 million of additional aid for the 2014-15 school year\nabove  the  aid  amount  that  is currently authorized by law. In recent\nyears, similar provisions have only been authorized in  the  context  of\nenacting the State budget.\n\n  Senate  Bill  Number  6124-A  would  validate  a  Perry Central School\nDistrict transportation contract, even though  the  district  failed  to\nmeet  long-standing statutory requirements for aid eligibility. Further,\nthis transportation contract falls  outside  the  scope  of  forgiveness\nprovisions that were negotiated by the Legislature and the Executive and\nincluded in the 2012-13 Enacted Budget, thereby undoing that agreed upon\nsolution.\n\n  Each  of  these  bills  would result in increased and unbudgeted State\ncosts. For the reasons stated above, I cannot approve these bills.\n\n  These bill are disapproved.                 (signed) ANDREW M. CUOMO\n                              __________\n",
    "signedDate": null,
    "signer": "ANDREW M. CUOMO",
    "vetoNumber": 517,
